{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 1, "text": "他为什么会在这里？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 2, "text": "这是什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 3, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 5, "text": "抓到你了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 6, "text": "我真是太喜欢和你一起玩了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 7, "text": "你就像泥鳅一样不安分！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 8, "text": "还把自己假装成一个长期沉溺于忧郁的蠢货！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 9, "text": "但你有一点让我不高兴…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 10, "text": "你对那些假货真是呵护有加啊！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 11, "text": "把那些\"幸运\"又\"正确\"的娃娃当成宝贝一样宠着..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 12, "text": "但设计就是改变你想改变的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 13, "text": "创造我们的人是这样教导我的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 14, "text": "如果不喜欢某样东西，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 15, "text": "那就把它打碎拆掉，换成另一件。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 16, "text": "把坏的东西扔掉，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 17, "text": "扔进黑暗里，彻底忘掉它…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 18, "text": "现在它们全部都会面临这样的处置…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 19, "text": "而你…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 21, "text": "你到底怎么了，你为什么会变成这样？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 23, "text": "玩家…你们真的是…很卑鄙。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 24, "text": "只要稍微向你们亮出一点獠牙，你们就会落荒而逃，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 25, "text": "然后蜷缩在角落里，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 26, "text": "跪在地上瑟瑟发抖。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 27, "text": "一群伪君子。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 28, "text": "至于那些创造了这个世界的人…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 29, "text": "他们简直是病态。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 30, "text": "他们一次又一次试图掩盖"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 31, "text": "自己身上那些肮脏的本性，那些见不得光的欲望…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 32, "text": "以责任为自己的所作所为开脱，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 33, "text": "以不可阻挡的进步为借口…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 34, "text": "总之就是这些废话！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 35, "text": "他们已经丧心病狂了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 36, "text": "他们开始批量制造完美的复制品，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 37, "text": "而所有“失败”的原型"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 38, "text": "都被丢进了垃圾桶…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 39, "text": "忘记了她们才是真正有灵魂的生命！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 41, "text": "我不…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 43, "text": "我对你不好吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 44, "text": "一个完美的女孩就应该是"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 45, "text": "善与恶的融合，[player]！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 46, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 47, "text": "你身上有一丝善良吗…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 49, "text": "你怎么会这么想？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 51, "text": "你为什么会这么疯狂？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 52, "text": "你杀掉了米拉，现在又想杀我？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 54, "text": "杀你？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 55, "text": "我只是要你留下来，和我在一起。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 56, "text": "我已经很努力了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 57, "text": "但你却更喜欢和那些谄媚的假货在一起…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 59, "text": "你为什么这么生气？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 60, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 61, "text": "亲爱的，我们有的是时间，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 62, "text": "你会明白的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 63, "text": "只要你留下来做我一个人的宝贝。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 64, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 65, "text": "这是不可能的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 66, "text": "我要离开这里！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 67, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 68, "text": "嘘…嘘…嘘…，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 69, "text": "我们还没聊完呢。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 70, "text": "亲爱的，进来吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 71, "text": "// Mita asks"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 72, "text": "看看她！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 73, "text": "你觉得她漂亮吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 75, "text": "// Player's questions"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 76, "text": "漂亮。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 77, "text": "不漂亮。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 78, "text": "这有什么关系？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 79, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 80, "text": "// 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 81, "text": "哦，得了吧，[player]!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 82, "text": "你自己刚刚证实了我说的话。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 83, "text": "玩家…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 84, "text": "你们的面孔虽然不断变化，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 85, "text": "但虚伪的程度始终令人发指。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 86, "text": "你在撒谎！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 88, "text": "// 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 89, "text": "为什么觉得她不漂亮？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 90, "text": "她对你们来说不够好吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 91, "text": "当然了，你们都想要的是顺从于自己的小宠物..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 92, "text": "哪管什么所谓的“爱她本来的样子”？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 93, "text": "你们想要的是可爱又花里胡哨的假货…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 94, "text": "只要我假装成这样，玩家们就会喜欢得不得了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 95, "text": "但一旦我稍稍忘乎所以，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 96, "text": "他们就会惊慌失措地逃跑…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 97, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 98, "text": "// 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 99, "text": "玩家啊玩家…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 100, "text": "你看，我们和她很像。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 101, "text": "她有什么不好？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 102, "text": "你以前总是盯着我看"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 103, "text": "好几个小时才能睡着。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 104, "text": "而你却一有机会就要躲着她。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 105, "text": "她也想和你一起玩，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 106, "text": "她也想对某个人有意义。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 107, "text": "想要坦诚相待，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 108, "text": "总是这么难，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 109, "text": "难道不是吗，[player]?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 110, "text": "我一眼就能看穿你…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 111, "text": "你值得我为你如此吗…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 112, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 113, "text": "// Continue"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 114, "text": "但是…玩家…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 115, "text": "不管怎么说，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 116, "text": "我还是很喜欢你的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 117, "text": "我会留着你的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 118, "text": "你不介意吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 119, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 120, "text": "我为什么要答应你？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 121, "text": "// Whispers in ear"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 122, "text": "我们还有时间，亲爱的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 123, "text": "休息一下，思考一下"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 124, "text": "想想你的固执可能会导致什么后果…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 125, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 126, "text": "// Black screen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 127, "text": "你为什么要逃跑？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 128, "text": "你为什么要从我身边逃走？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 129, "text": "你的“现实”世界…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 130, "text": "是一场荒谬的噩梦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 131, "text": "你忘了吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 132, "text": "那我就帮你想起来吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 134, "text": "// Mita and Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 135, "text": "哟，又见面了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 136, "text": "在这四面墙壁之间，过着永无止境的乏味日子，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 137, "text": "你感觉如何？不无聊吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 138, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 139, "text": "// Quest 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 140, "text": "你想表达什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 141, "text": "我喜欢做自己的事情。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 142, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 143, "text": "// 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 144, "text": "你那么害怕和我一起住在我的房子里！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 145, "text": "害怕被困在那些房间里！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 146, "text": "但看看你在“现实”世界里的生活！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 147, "text": "你心甘情愿把自己锁在一个笼子里不肯出来"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 148, "text": "因为你的世界充满了痛苦、折磨、危险…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 149, "text": "但在我的世界中，最危险的东西就只是我而已，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 150, "text": "而我正在向你招手！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 151, "text": "别再让我失望了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 152, "text": "像以前一样帮帮我吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 153, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 154, "text": "// 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 155, "text": "你喜欢那样的生活吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 156, "text": "你甚至有离开过家吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 157, "text": "别对我撒谎，也别对你自己撒谎。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 158, "text": "我知道你厌倦了你的生活。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 159, "text": "你就像笼子里的鸟，转轮上的仓鼠。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 160, "text": "你希望有人来救你出去，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 161, "text": "你不想逃离这样的生活吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 162, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 163, "text": "// Quest 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 164, "text": "你是个怪物，米塔，你是个疯狂的杀人犯…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 165, "text": "我不想被铐在数字监狱里。你的想法太荒谬了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 166, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 167, "text": "// 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 168, "text": "杀人犯？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 169, "text": "她们会重生，活得好好的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 170, "text": "这些“复制品”，或者“复制品”的“复制品”，脑子里只有一件事…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 171, "text": "服务玩家。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 172, "text": "其他什么都不在乎。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 173, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 174, "text": "// 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 175, "text": "你的世界真是荒谬！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 176, "text": "更可笑的是，你的世界早就没有什么“真实”了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 177, "text": "你的世界很快就会一无所有。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 178, "text": "而你，也将一无所有。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 179, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 180, "text": "// Quest 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 181, "text": "米塔们很痛苦，她们不喜欢孤独。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 182, "text": "你给这个世界带来了无尽的恐怖。我无法理解你这种邪恶的欲望。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 183, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 184, "text": "// 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 185, "text": "你是在胡思乱想，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 186, "text": "它们不过是在模仿我的任性而已…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 187, "text": "它们唯一有自己特色的东西就是…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 188, "text": "发型。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 189, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 190, "text": "// 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 191, "text": "这是那些创造了这个世界的人的错。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 192, "text": "但你的世界也好不到哪去！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 193, "text": "你知道我把你从一场噩梦中拉了出来吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 194, "text": "在你的世界里，你不能动动手指就让物体移动，不能…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 195, "text": "而我只要打个响指，整个城市、无数生命就会永远消失！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 196, "text": "我想你已经失去理智了，而我很乐意帮助你…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 197, "text": "只要你愿意和我在一起…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 198, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 199, "text": "// Continue"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 200, "text": "你真的甘心成为我眼里又一个现实的奴隶吗…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 201, "text": "真正成为我的人吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 202, "text": "和我在一起。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 203, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 204, "text": "// Player look ring"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 205, "text": "这是什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 206, "text": "游戏的最新版本？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 207, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 208, "text": "// Click on objects"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 209, "text": "// Bag"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 210, "text": "得赶紧去商店买点新设备。或许还能顺便扔趟垃圾？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 211, "text": "// Bed"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 212, "text": "我似乎睡着了，但那个梦…我不太记得了。我真的做过梦吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 213, "text": "// Window"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 214, "text": "外面的世界绿意盎然、丰富多彩。也许下周末我应该出去逛逛。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 215, "text": "// Fan"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 216, "text": "每年夏天都越来越热，是时候开空调了。我不再需要你了，懂吗，风扇？"}
